    {
      "text": "not a soul which Moses does not behold, Moses 1:28. man became living soul, Moses 3:7, 9 (6:9; Abr. 5:7). Satan promises that not one soul will be lost, Moses 4:1. through birth men become of dust living soul, Moses 6:59. Enoch2 has bitterness of soul because of men’s wickedness, Moses 7:44. soul of Enoch2 rejoices because of coming of the Son, Moses 7:47. Abraham and Lot bring to Canaan the souls won in Haran, Abr. 2:15. Abraham to say Sarai is his sister, that his soul may live, Abr. 2:24–25. God saw souls in premortal world that they were good, Abr. 3:23.",
